{"sections":[{"slug":"稳定化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"稳定化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"稳定化"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以下的范畴默认为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">每个具有有限极限的范畴都存在稳定化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即自由地变成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">稳定化可以构造为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">带基点范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的稳定化是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"$\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm L}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C =\\operatorname{colim}(\\mathcal C\\overset{\\Sigma}{\\to}\\mathcal C\\overset{\\Sigma}{\\to}\\cdots),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即形式上令</span> $\\Sigma$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆得到的范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">参见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式取逆","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式取逆</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">为了计算该余极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">注意到它等价于</span> $\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm R}\\simeq (\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm L})^{\\mathrm {op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的极限</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{lim}(\\cdots\\overset{\\Omega}{\\to}\\mathcal C_*\\overset{\\Omega}{\\to}\\mathcal C_*).\r\n$$\n$\\mathrm{Pr}^{\\mathrm{R}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的极限可在</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\infty}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中计算</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记上述极限到各个分量的投影为</span> $\\Omega^{\\infty -n}$, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个对象</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一列空间</span> $X_n :=\\Omega^{\\infty -n}X$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及一族等价</span>\n$$\r\nX_{n}\\simeq\\Omega X_{n+1}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这是传统的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span> $\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">继承</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的有限极限</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间有伴随</span> $\\Sigma^\\infty \\dashv \\Omega^\\infty$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及更一般的</span> $\\Sigma^{\\infty -n}\\dashv\\Omega^{\\infty -n}$. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $X\\in\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\nX\\simeq\\operatorname{colim}\\Sigma^{\\infty -n}\\Omega^{\\infty-n}X.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}